(5639454, 817191, 27161, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thatsanicepicture:</b></div><hr/><i> The followers of the religion "The Flying Spaghetti Monster" are sure to see this as a sign and aplomb76 is soon the be sainted.  Coincidence  ?  I think not!   LOL!!!<br/> <br/>(For those that have not heard of "The Flying Spaghetti Monster" religion.  <a href="//www.venganza.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.venganza.org/</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your your comment.  I do believe I was shall I say "touched" by the FSM and compelled to create it.  I sent an email to venganza.org offering to let them post my photos in support of the cause.<br/> <br/>Thanks again, Brian<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by thatsanicepicture: The followers of the religion "The Flying Spaghetti Monster" are sure to see this as a sign and aplomb76 is soon the be sainted.  Coincidence  ?  I think not!   LOL!!! (For those that have not heard of "The Flying Spaghetti Monster" religion.  //www.venganza.org/   Thank you for your your comment.  I do believe I was shall I say "touched" by the FSM and compelled to create it.  I sent an email to venganza.org offering to let them post my photos in support of the cause. Thanks again, Brian', '2009-09-07 20:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
