(5639765, 817871, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hey <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=91730" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hey_You_3000</a>! I think the textures and colors on this shot are nice. The focus on the green noodle at the left is nice too, because i think the focus on this white noodle at the middle would be a little obvious. The subject is really simple but the light (despite the harsh points at the "middle-noodle") and the black background add much to the composition. There are three bright points at the left (i hope it''s not my monitor!) which i think you could "erase", they are not really distracting but kind of weird. I like the shot in general, you did a good job with a simple subject!<br/>Congrats for your second best score. Good luck on the next challenge too! <br/>Sorry for any rude point of view!<br/>Cheers!<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Hey  Hey_You_3000! I think the textures and colors on this shot are nice. The focus on the green noodle at the left is nice too, because i think the focus on this white noodle at the middle would be a little obvious. The subject is really simple but the light (despite the harsh points at the "middle-noodle") and the black background add much to the composition. There are three bright points at the left (i hope it''s not my monitor!) which i think you could "erase", they are not really distracting but kind of weird. I like the shot in general, you did a good job with a simple subject!Congrats for your second best score. Good luck on the next challenge too! Sorry for any rude point of view!Cheers! Pedro', '2009-09-08 00:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
